OL,3,AHarry Potter films at 25:
OL,4,ABehind-the-scenes quiz
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt has been 25 years since Harry Potter
OL,7,Fflew into cinemas in the first film in
OL,8,Fthe wizarding franchise.
OL,10,FAll eight films were shot at Warner
OL,11,FBros. Studios Leavesden in
OL,12,FHertfordshire.
OL,14,FThe upcoming Harry Potter HBO series
OL,15,Fhas been shot at the same location.
OL,17,FTest your knowledge and see how well
OL,18,Fyou know how these films were made.
